he provided specifications, making sure to include clear documentation for each environment variable. I want to include all of the environment variables shown, so that the user has a proper example to copy and paste. I\'m taking special care to include the POSTIZ_URL for port 3000, and am now checking the server build instructions.\n\n\n**Constructing Python Backend**\n\nI\'m now focusing on creating the Python backend, which will service all the API endpoints I\'ve outlined. This will involve defining routes for health checks, job management, vault access, Telegram bot command execution, and code file retrieval. I need to ensure a robust and modular structure to handle the variety of requests, and will carefully design the Python classes to interact with the database, and trigger the agents, including the Gemini API.\n\n\n"
