erface with a header displaying \"CONTENT-FACTORY\", a budget tracker, and primary navigation tabs for Pipeline & Active Jobs, and HITL Telegram Terminal. I\'m aiming for an interactive, responsive experience.\n\n\n**Designing The User Interface**\n\nI\'m now detailing the user interface elements. I\'m focusing on the **Agents & Tools Studio**, a detailed inspector for the nine agents and various tools, plus a **Vault Data Explorer** for style guides and more. I\'m sketching out a **New Job Modal** with niche presets and customizable configurations like target duration and platform. The 10-stage stepper for progress, highlighting critical stages like `SCRIPT`, `QC1`, and `QC2`, is next. The project codebase will have an interactive file explorer to view crucial project files.\n\n\n"
