  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Project Architecture**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the project, specifically designing the architecture for `src/`. I\'ve outlined `src/types.ts` to include TypeScript interfaces for `Job` and `Stage`. The goal is a rich, interactive web dashboard for **CONTENT-FACTORY**, directly connected to the backend APIs on port 3000. For now, `src/App.tsx` is an empty placeholder.\n\n\n**Visualizing UI Components**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out UI components, expanding on the `src/components` directory. I\'m focusing on key features within `PipelineBoard.tsx`, like the interactive workflow map for CONTENT-FACTORY. The aim is a real-time, detailed view of active jobs, including status indicators and filters. I\'m also planning the job detail view, handling agent output, approval stages, premium video options, and cost tracking.\n\n\n**Simulating Telegram HITL**\n\nI\'m now implementing the HITL interface simulation, planning a realistic Telegram-like experience within the dashboard. This involves interactive chat input and quick action buttons for all 14 commands. I\'m focusing on real-time bot responses using Markdown and code formatting.\n\nI\'m also working on deep-dive cards for each of the nine Agents, including the ManagerAgent, ResearcherAgent, ScriptwriterAgent, StyleAnalystAgent, ArtDirectorAgent, VideoEditorAgent, QualityControlAgent, PosterAgent, and AnalystAgent. These cards will feature detailed information, and a tool integrations list.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 428540710
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
