  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the complete **CONTENT-FACTORY** Multi-Agent AI Content Automation Pipeline and interactive control dashboard.\n\n### Core Architecture & Capabilities\n\n- **10-Stage Pipeline Engine**:\n  - Implemented the end-to-end 10-stage sequential lifecycle: `IDEA` \342\206\222 `RESEARCH` \342\206\222 `SCRIPT` \342\206\222 `QC1` \342\206\222 `STYLE` \342\206\222 `ART` \342\206\222 `VIDEO` \342\206\222 `QC2` \342\206\222 `POST` \342\206\222 `ANALYZE`.\n  - Built-in **Human-in-the-Loop (HITL)** approval gates at `SCRIPT`, `QC1`, and `QC2`, halting the pipeline until explicit approval or revision feedback is provided.\n  - Implemented the **Premium Escalation Path** for video rendering, enabling escalation to `AWAITING_PREMIUM` when 4K/8K generative video models (Veo 3.1, Luma, Flow) are configured.\n\n- **9 Specialized Autonomous Agents**:\n  - **ManagerAgent**: Translates high-level niche goals into strategic production plans, target retention metrics, and formats.\n  - **ResearcherAgent**: Analyzes competitor breakout formats via YouTube Data API and search engines with virality scoring.\n  - **ScriptwriterAgent**: Writes 35\342\200\22340s vertical scripts with 3-second psychological hooks, 3-act tension loops, CTAs, and platform variants.\n  - **StyleAnalystAgent**: Extracts visual DNA, cinematic palettes, cut frequencies (1.8s), and audio mood profiles.\n  - **ArtDirectorAgent**: Generates 5-shot prompt packs for Veo 3.1 & Nano-Banana along with character bibles.\n  - **VideoEditorAgent**: Automates narration synthesis, dynamic ASS captions, and retention pacing.\n  - **QualityControlAgent**: Audits originality (Jina), content policies, audio loudness (-14 LUFS), and safe-zone margins.\n  - **PosterAgent**: Formats platform tags and dispatches scheduled releases through the Postiz API.\n  - **AnalystAgent**: Evaluates second-by-second audience retention curves, calculates creator rewards, and feeds winning hooks back into the style guide vault.\n\n- **Gemini Intelligence & Cost Circuit Breaker**:\n  - Configured server-side model routing across `gemini-3.7-flash` (fast reasoning), `gemini-2.5-pro` (complex scripts and prompts), and `gemini-vision` (frame analysis).\n  - Integrated `tenacity` exponential backoff for `ResourceExhausted` rate-limiting resilience.\n  - Continuous token and cost tracking with a strict daily circuit breaker against `DAILY_BUDGET_USD` ($5.00 default).\n\n- **Telegram HITL Bot & Web Console Simulator**:\n  - Registered all 14 requested bot commands: `/goal`, `/status`, `/pending`, `/approve`, `/reject`, `/variants`, `/preview`, `/premium`, `/upload_premium`, `/post`, `/analyze`, `/cost`, `/report`, and `/help`.\n  - Provided an interactive Telegram terminal emulator in the dashboard to test and execute commands in real time.\n\n- **Vault Database & Specifications**:\n  - Implemented 13 async SQLAlchemy 2.0 database models for Jobs, Stages, Assets, Approvals, Costs, StyleGuides, CharacterBibles, HookFormulas, and Analytics.\n  - Generated full production configs: `requirements.txt`, `docker-compose.yml`, `PROJECT_SPEC.md`, `TECHNICAL_SPEC.md`, and `README.md`."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the complete **CONTENT-FACTORY** Multi-Agent AI Content Automation Pipeline and interactive control dashboard.\n\n### Core Architecture & Capabilities\n\n- **10-Stage Pipeline Engine**:\n  - Implemented the end-to-end 10-stage sequential lifecycle: `IDEA` \342\206\222 `RESEARCH` \342\206\222 `SCRIPT` \342\206\222 `QC1` \342\206\222 `STYLE` \342\206\222 `ART` \342\206\222 `VIDEO` \342\206\222 `QC2` \342\206\222 `POST` \342\206\222 `ANALYZE`.\n  - Built-in **Human-in-the-Loop (HITL)** approval gates at `SCRIPT`, `QC1`, and `QC2`, halting the pipeline until explicit approval or revision feedback is provided.\n  - Implemented the **Premium Escalation Path** for video rendering, enabling escalation to `AWAITING_PREMIUM` when 4K/8K generative video models (Veo 3.1, Luma, Flow) are configured.\n\n- **9 Specialized Autonomous Agents**:\n  - **ManagerAgent**: Translates high-level niche goals into strategic production plans, target retention metrics, and formats.\n  - **ResearcherAgent**: Analyzes competitor breakout formats via YouTube Data API and search engines with virality scoring.\n  - **ScriptwriterAgent**: Writes 35\342\200\22340s vertical scripts with 3-second psychological hooks, 3-act tension loops, CTAs, and platform variants.\n  - **StyleAnalystAgent**: Extracts visual DNA, cinematic palettes, cut frequencies (1.8s), and audio mood profiles.\n  - **ArtDirectorAgent**: Generates 5-shot prompt packs for Veo 3.1 & Nano-Banana along with character bibles.\n  - **VideoEditorAgent**: Automates narration synthesis, dynamic ASS captions, and retention pacing.\n  - **QualityControlAgent**: Audits originality (Jina), content policies, audio loudness (-14 LUFS), and safe-zone margins.\n  - **PosterAgent**: Formats platform tags and dispatches scheduled releases through the Postiz API.\n  - **AnalystAgent**: Evaluates second-by-second audience retention curves, calculates creator rewards, and feeds winning hooks back into the style guide vault.\n\n- **Gemini Intelligence & Cost Circuit Breaker**:\n  - Configured server-side model routing across `gemini-3.7-flash` (fast reasoning), `gemini-2.5-pro` (complex scripts and prompts), and `gemini-vision` (frame analysis).\n  - Integrated `tenacity` exponential backoff for `ResourceExhausted` rate-limiting resilience.\n  - Continuous token and cost tracking with a strict daily circuit breaker against `DAILY_BUDGET_USD` ($5.00 default).\n\n- **Telegram HITL Bot & Web Console Simulator**:\n  - Registered all 14 requested bot commands: `/goal`, `/status`, `/pending`, `/approve`, `/reject`, `/variants`, `/preview`, `/premium`, `/upload_premium`, `/post`, `/analyze`, `/cost`, `/report`, and `/help`.\n  - Provided an interactive Telegram terminal emulator in the dashboard to test and execute commands in real time.\n\n- **Vault Database & Specifications**:\n  - Implemented 13 async SQLAlchemy 2.0 database models for Jobs, Stages, Assets, Approvals, Costs, StyleGuides, CharacterBibles, HookFormulas, and Analytics.\n  - Generated full production configs: `requirements.txt`, `docker-compose.yml`, `PROJECT_SPEC.md`, `TECHNICAL_SPEC.md`, and `README.md`."
