'm noting the dynamic data display in the total savings tile with a circular progress indicator. I\'m also observing the components within the Active Pipeline and Selected Job Details columns, paying close attention to the filter pill buttons and job cards, and how the status badges are styled using background colors. The Job Banner with the badge and indigo action button are critical to the design. The HITL Gate Box also has interesting styling!\n\n\n"
