  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Bento Grid Styling**\n\nI\'m currently focused on styling the `PipelineBoard.tsx` component, specifically the top Bento row. I\'m aiming for the Bento Grid aesthetic. I\'m considering a dark background and border colors for the Bento container, using `bg-[#18181b]` and `border border-[#27272a]` respectively. My attention is now on determining suitable styles to use to represent a 10 stage pipeline.\n\n\n**Refining Bento Stage Styles**\n\nI\'ve been iterating on the styling for the Bento grid\'s stage indicators. I\'m focusing on visual cues for active, completed, and \"HITL Waiting\" stages. I\'m leveraging distinct colors and subtle shadows to differentiate these states, and making use of Tailwind rings. I\'m now exploring the optimal display of the mini Bento metric cards.\n\n\n**Defining Bento Card Layout**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the layout of the main area Bento card. I\'ve broken it down into a left column and a right column, and I\'m currently focusing on the left column\'s Bento card. I\'ve defined its background, border, and padding, and am using Tailwind utility classes like `shadow-sm`,  `rounded-3xl`, and `p-6` to establish the visual foundation. I\'m thinking of setting up the header and filter buttons next.\n\n\n**Styling Bento Details**\n\nI\'m now diving into the styling details of the main Bento card\'s right column. I\'m focusing on the \"Job Details Banner\" with its various states: the advance button (with a specific indigo hover effect), the HITL gate approval banner, and the premium render banner. I\'m also styling the \"Stage Execution Logs\" area, aiming for a consistent aesthetic with rounded corners, and step badges.\n\n\n**Styling Bento Components**\n\nI\'m now styling several Bento components. I\'m focusing on consistency in container styles using dark backgrounds, rounded corners, and subtle shadows. I\'m exploring the specific styling for badges (success, error), and inner blocks to improve visual hierarchy. I\'m also now styling the \"Fleet Status Bento Card,\" aiming for a clean and informative display of agent information.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 181474633
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
