g out node statuses (CheckSquare/ShieldCheck, POST, ANALYZE). The connection lines will feature dynamic bezier paths: green completed, amber active with an animated pulse, and subtle slate for pending steps. Node interactivity includes four connection handles, a status dot, hover effects, and a right-side drawer that allows viewing agent reasoning, LLM inputs & outputs, token count, cost, and options to advance, approve, or reject. Plus a test run of the node with Gemini. Floating canvas controls are being planned for the bottom-left.\n\n\n**Adding the Finishing Touches**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the final UI components and integrations. I\'m incorporating floating canvas controls for zoom and view adjustments: zoom in/out, fit view, and pan lock/unlock. I\'m also planning a mini-map in the bottom-right for easy navigation, replicating the screenshot\'s functionality, with node dots, active viewport, and a React Flow badge. I\'m finalizing the dark bottom status bar, incorporating dynamic data for today\'s videos, views, and spending, all from live metrics. Finally, I\'ve confirmed relevant icons exist in the lucide-react library.\n\n\n"
