  user_input {
    user_response: "okay use this pic and redo as refrence it should be broad like this current one i just want something that i cn use to implement the details needed and the bcakend/function should do wat they were intended to do?\nand should have some necessary part from the currently built work and it should show real data not fake data based on this\n# CONTENT-FACTORY: Free Tier APIs & Models Reference\n\n---\n\n## LLM & Vision (Google AI Studio)\n\n| Model | Purpose | Free Tier Limits | Why This Model |\n|-------|---------|------------------|----------------|\n| **gemini-3.6-flash** | Primary LLM (Researcher, Scriptwriter, Manager, QC, Analyst) | 15 RPM, 1,500 RPD, 1M tokens/min | Latest flash model, fastest/cheapest, supports JSON schema, function calling, 1M context |\n| **gemini-3.7-flash** | Complex reasoning (Art Director, Style Analyst prompts) | 10 RPM, 1,000 RPD | Slightly higher quality for creative tasks |\n| **gemini-2.5-pro** | Vision analysis (Style Analyst, Video Editor frame review) | 5 RPM, 100 RPD | Best vision understanding, handles video frames + images |\n\n**API Key**: `GEMINI_API_KEY` from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (format: `AIzaSy...`)\n\n**Why Google AI Studio**: Only provider with generous free tier (1.5M tokens/day) + vision + JSON schema + function calling all in one. No credit card required.\n\n---\n\n## Video Search & Trends\n\n| API | Purpose | Free Tier | Why |\n|-----|---------|-----------|-----|\n| **YouTube Data API v3** | Search trending videos by niche/keyword, get view counts, metadata | 10,000 units/day (~500 searches) | Only reliable source for real YouTube trend data; required for Researcher |\n| **Tavily Search** | Web search for trending topics, news, statistics | 1,000 requests/month | Built for AI agents, returns clean JSON, includes citations |\n| **SerpAPI** | Google search fallback (shopping, local, news) | 100 searches/month | Broader web coverage when Tavily misses |\n| **Firecrawl** | Scrape full article content from URLs | 500 credits/month (free tier) | Extracts clean markdown from any URL for research depth |\n| **Jina AI Reader** | Free URL \342\206\222 markdown (no key needed) | Unlimited | Zero-cost fallback for content extraction |\n\n**Keys**: `YOUTUBE_API_KEY`, `TAVILY_API_KEY`, `SERPAPI_KEY`, `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY`\n\n---\n\n## Images & Visual Assets\n\n| Service | Purpose | Free Tier | Why |\n|---------|---------|-----------|-----|\n| **Pexels API** | Stock photos/videos for B-roll, thumbnails | 200 requests/hour, 20,000/month | High quality, royalty-free, no attribution required, video clips available |\n| **ComfyUI (local)** | Custom image generation (optional) | Unlimited (run locally) | Zero cost, full control, runs on your GPU |\n\n**Key**: `PEXELS_API_KEY` from https://www.pexels.com/api/\n\n**Why Pexels**: Best free stock API with video clips. Commercial use allowed. No watermarks.\n\n---\n\n## Voice / TTS\n\n| Engine | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|--------|---------|------|-----|\n| **Edge-TTS** (Microsoft) | Narration for all videos | **FREE** (no API key) | 100+ voices, SSML support, runs locally via `edge-tts` Python pkg, no rate limits |\n\n**Config**: `TTS_ENGINE=edge`, `TTS_VOICE=en-US-AriaNeural` (or any from `edge-tts --list-voices`)\n\n**Why Edge-TTS**: Only truly free, high-quality neural TTS with no limits. Used by major creators.\n\n---\n\n## Video Assembly\n\n| Tool | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|------|---------|------|-----|\n| **FFmpeg** | Concatenate clips, add audio, burn captions, encode final MP4 | **FREE** (local binary) | Industry standard, hardware acceleration, zero cost, full control |\n\n**Config**: `VIDEO_ENGINE=ffmpeg`, `FFMPEG_PATH=ffmpeg` (must be in PATH)\n\n**Why FFmpeg**: Only free option that handles everything: filtering, encoding, captions, concatenation.\n\n---\n\n## Social Media Posting\n\n| Service | Purpose | Free Tier | Why |\n|---------|---------|-----------|-----|\n| **Postiz** (self-hosted) | Schedule/post to TikTok, IG, YT, LinkedIn, X, FB | **FREE** (self-hosted) | Open source, supports all major platforms, web UI + API, multi-account |\n\n**Keys**: `POSTIZ_URL=http://localhost:3000`, `POSTIZ_API_KEY` (from Postiz Settings > API)\n\n**Why Postiz**: Only free, open-source multi-platform scheduler with API. Buffer/Hootsuite/Metricool all paid.\n\n---\n\n## Human Approval & Control\n\n| Service | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|---------|---------|------|-----|\n| **Telegram Bot** | Approve/reject stages, set goals, view status, upload premium videos | **FREE** | Real-time push notifications, file upload support, inline keyboards, no polling cost |\n\n**Keys**: `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` (from @BotFather), `TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS_RAW` (your user IDs from @userinfobot)\n\n**Why Telegram**: Only free, programmable messaging with file upload + inline buttons + no webhook hosting needed (long polling).\n\n---\n\n## Database\n\n| Option | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|--------|---------|------|-----|\n| **SQLite** (default) | Local dev, single-user | **FREE** | Zero config, file-based, perfect for dev/solo |\n| **PostgreSQL + pgvector** | Production, multi-user, vector search | Free (self-hosted) | Scales, supports embeddings for future semantic search |\n\n**Config**: `DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./vault.db`, `USE_POSTGRES=false`\n\n---\n\n## Optional Premium (Manual Only)\n\n| Service | Purpose | Cost | Usage |\n|---------|---------|------|-------|\n| **Google Veo / Flow** (via browser) | Cinematic video generation | **$20/mo** (Gemini Pro plan) | Manual: Art Director outputs prompt packs \342\206\222 you paste in browser \342\206\222 download \342\206\222 upload via `/upload_premium` |\n\n**Why not automated**: No API access yet. Browser-only. Your $20 plan covers this.\n\n---\n\n## Summary: Required `.env` Keys (Free Tier Only)\n\n```ini\n# REQUIRED - Core\nGEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...           # Google AI Studio (LLM + Vision)\nYOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...          # YouTube Data API v3 (trends)\nPEXELS_API_KEY=563492ad...         # Stock images/video\nTELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456:ABC...   # BotFather token\nTELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS_RAW=123456789,987654321  # Your user IDs\n\n# REQUIRED - Posting (after docker-compose up -d)\nPOSTIZ_URL=http://localhost:3000\nPOSTIZ_API_KEY=pz_abcdef...\n\n# OPTIONAL - Enhanced Research (add if you hit limits)\nTAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-...            # 1000 req/mo free\nSERPAPI_KEY=abc...                 # 100 searches/mo free\nFIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...           # 500 credits/mo free\n\n# OPTIONAL - Local overrides\nDATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./vault.db\nUSE_POSTGRES=false\n```\n\n---\n\n## Why This Stack Wins on Free Tier\n\n| Category | Monthly Cost | Alternative (Paid) |\n|----------|--------------|-------------------|\n| LLM + Vision | $0 (1.5M tokens/day) | OpenAI $50+/mo |\n| Video Search | $0 (10k units/day) | $200+/mo for similar data |\n| Stock Media | $0 (20k req/mo) | Storyblocks $30/mo |\n| TTS | $0 (unlimited) | ElevenLabs $22/mo |\n| Video Encoding | $0 (local) | Cloud $0.10+/min |\n| Scheduling | $0 (self-hosted) | Buffer $6/mo/channel |\n| Control/Alerts | $0 (Telegram) | Slack $7.25/user/mo |\n| **Total** | **$0** | **$300+/mo** |\n\nYour only cost: **$20/mo Gemini Pro** for Veo/Flow browser access (manual step). Everything else runs free, locally, or self-hosted."
    items {
      text: "okay use this pic and redo as refrence it should be broad like this current one i just want something that i cn use to implement the details needed and the bcakend/function should do wat they were intended to do?\nand should have some necessary part from the currently built work and it should show real data not fake data based on this\n# CONTENT-FACTORY: Free Tier APIs & Models Reference\n\n---\n\n## LLM & Vision (Google AI Studio)\n\n| Model | Purpose | Free Tier Limits | Why This Model |\n|-------|---------|------------------|----------------|\n| **gemini-3.6-flash** | Primary LLM (Researcher, Scriptwriter, Manager, QC, Analyst) | 15 RPM, 1,500 RPD, 1M tokens/min | Latest flash model, fastest/cheapest, supports JSON schema, function calling, 1M context |\n| **gemini-3.7-flash** | Complex reasoning (Art Director, Style Analyst prompts) | 10 RPM, 1,000 RPD | Slightly higher quality for creative tasks |\n| **gemini-2.5-pro** | Vision analysis (Style Analyst, Video Editor frame review) | 5 RPM, 100 RPD | Best vision understanding, handles video frames + images |\n\n**API Key**: `GEMINI_API_KEY` from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (format: `AIzaSy...`)\n\n**Why Google AI Studio**: Only provider with generous free tier (1.5M tokens/day) + vision + JSON schema + function calling all in one. No credit card required.\n\n---\n\n## Video Search & Trends\n\n| API | Purpose | Free Tier | Why |\n|-----|---------|-----------|-----|\n| **YouTube Data API v3** | Search trending videos by niche/keyword, get view counts, metadata | 10,000 units/day (~500 searches) | Only reliable source for real YouTube trend data; required for Researcher |\n| **Tavily Search** | Web search for trending topics, news, statistics | 1,000 requests/month | Built for AI agents, returns clean JSON, includes citations |\n| **SerpAPI** | Google search fallback (shopping, local, news) | 100 searches/month | Broader web coverage when Tavily misses |\n| **Firecrawl** | Scrape full article content from URLs | 500 credits/month (free tier) | Extracts clean markdown from any URL for research depth |\n| **Jina AI Reader** | Free URL \342\206\222 markdown (no key needed) | Unlimited | Zero-cost fallback for content extraction |\n\n**Keys**: `YOUTUBE_API_KEY`, `TAVILY_API_KEY`, `SERPAPI_KEY`, `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY`\n\n---\n\n## Images & Visual Assets\n\n| Service | Purpose | Free Tier | Why |\n|---------|---------|-----------|-----|\n| **Pexels API** | Stock photos/videos for B-roll, thumbnails | 200 requests/hour, 20,000/month | High quality, royalty-free, no attribution required, video clips available |\n| **ComfyUI (local)** | Custom image generation (optional) | Unlimited (run locally) | Zero cost, full control, runs on your GPU |\n\n**Key**: `PEXELS_API_KEY` from https://www.pexels.com/api/\n\n**Why Pexels**: Best free stock API with video clips. Commercial use allowed. No watermarks.\n\n---\n\n## Voice / TTS\n\n| Engine | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|--------|---------|------|-----|\n| **Edge-TTS** (Microsoft) | Narration for all videos | **FREE** (no API key) | 100+ voices, SSML support, runs locally via `edge-tts` Python pkg, no rate limits |\n\n**Config**: `TTS_ENGINE=edge`, `TTS_VOICE=en-US-AriaNeural` (or any from `edge-tts --list-voices`)\n\n**Why Edge-TTS**: Only truly free, high-quality neural TTS with no limits. Used by major creators.\n\n---\n\n## Video Assembly\n\n| Tool | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|------|---------|------|-----|\n| **FFmpeg** | Concatenate clips, add audio, burn captions, encode final MP4 | **FREE** (local binary) | Industry standard, hardware acceleration, zero cost, full control |\n\n**Config**: `VIDEO_ENGINE=ffmpeg`, `FFMPEG_PATH=ffmpeg` (must be in PATH)\n\n**Why FFmpeg**: Only free option that handles everything: filtering, encoding, captions, concatenation.\n\n---\n\n## Social Media Posting\n\n| Service | Purpose | Free Tier | Why |\n|---------|---------|-----------|-----|\n| **Postiz** (self-hosted) | Schedule/post to TikTok, IG, YT, LinkedIn, X, FB | **FREE** (self-hosted) | Open source, supports all major platforms, web UI + API, multi-account |\n\n**Keys**: `POSTIZ_URL=http://localhost:3000`, `POSTIZ_API_KEY` (from Postiz Settings > API)\n\n**Why Postiz**: Only free, open-source multi-platform scheduler with API. Buffer/Hootsuite/Metricool all paid.\n\n---\n\n## Human Approval & Control\n\n| Service | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|---------|---------|------|-----|\n| **Telegram Bot** | Approve/reject stages, set goals, view status, upload premium videos | **FREE** | Real-time push notifications, file upload support, inline keyboards, no polling cost |\n\n**Keys**: `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` (from @BotFather), `TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS_RAW` (your user IDs from @userinfobot)\n\n**Why Telegram**: Only free, programmable messaging with file upload + inline buttons + no webhook hosting needed (long polling).\n\n---\n\n## Database\n\n| Option | Purpose | Cost | Why |\n|--------|---------|------|-----|\n| **SQLite** (default) | Local dev, single-user | **FREE** | Zero config, file-based, perfect for dev/solo |\n| **PostgreSQL + pgvector** | Production, multi-user, vector search | Free (self-hosted) | Scales, supports embeddings for future semantic search |\n\n**Config**: `DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./vault.db`, `USE_POSTGRES=false`\n\n---\n\n## Optional Premium (Manual Only)\n\n| Service | Purpose | Cost | Usage |\n|---------|---------|------|-------|\n| **Google Veo / Flow** (via browser) | Cinematic video generation | **$20/mo** (Gemini Pro plan) | Manual: Art Director outputs prompt packs \342\206\222 you paste in browser \342\206\222 download \342\206\222 upload via `/upload_premium` |\n\n**Why not automated**: No API access yet. Browser-only. Your $20 plan covers this.\n\n---\n\n## Summary: Required `.env` Keys (Free Tier Only)\n\n```ini\n# REQUIRED - Core\nGEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...           # Google AI Studio (LLM + Vision)\nYOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...          # YouTube Data API v3 (trends)\nPEXELS_API_KEY=563492ad...         # Stock images/video\nTELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456:ABC...   # BotFather token\nTELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS_RAW=123456789,987654321  # Your user IDs\n\n# REQUIRED - Posting (after docker-compose up -d)\nPOSTIZ_URL=http://localhost:3000\nPOSTIZ_API_KEY=pz_abcdef...\n\n# OPTIONAL - Enhanced Research (add if you hit limits)\nTAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-...            # 1000 req/mo free\nSERPAPI_KEY=abc...                 # 100 searches/mo free\nFIRECRAWL_API_KEY=fc-...           # 500 credits/mo free\n\n# OPTIONAL - Local overrides\nDATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./vault.db\nUSE_POSTGRES=false\n```\n\n---\n\n## Why This Stack Wins on Free Tier\n\n| Category | Monthly Cost | Alternative (Paid) |\n|----------|--------------|-------------------|\n| LLM + Vision | $0 (1.5M tokens/day) | OpenAI $50+/mo |\n| Video Search | $0 (10k units/day) | $200+/mo for similar data |\n| Stock Media | $0 (20k req/mo) | Storyblocks $30/mo |\n| TTS | $0 (unlimited) | ElevenLabs $22/mo |\n| Video Encoding | $0 (local) | Cloud $0.10+/min |\n| Scheduling | $0 (self-hosted) | Buffer $6/mo/channel |\n| Control/Alerts | $0 (Telegram) | Slack $7.25/user/mo |\n| **Total** | **$0** | **$300+/mo** |\n\nYour only cost: **$20/mo Gemini Pro** for Veo/Flow browser access (manual step). Everything else runs free, locally, or self-hosted."
