ding videos by niche/keyword, get view counts, metadata\",\n      freeTier: \"10,000 units/day (~500 searches)\",\n      why: \"Only reliable source for real YouTube trend data; required for Researcher\",\n      keyName: \"YOUTUBE_API_KEY\",\n      isConfigured: Boolean(process.env.YOUTUBE_API_KEY)\n    },\n    {\n      api: \"Tavily Search\",\n      purpose: \"Web search for trending topics, news, statistics\",\n      freeTier: \"1,000 requests/month\",\n      why: \"Built for AI agents, returns clean JSON, includes citations\",\n      keyName: \"TAVILY_API_KEY\",\n      isConfigured: Boolean(process.env.TAVILY_API_KEY)\n    },\n    {\n      api: \"SerpAPI\",\n      purpose: \"Google search fallback (shopping, local, news)\",\n      freeTier: \"100 searches/month\",\n      why: \"Broader web coverage when Tavily misses\",\n      keyName: \"SERPAPI_KEY\",\n      isConfigured: Boolean(process.env.SERPAPI_KEY)\n    },\n    {\n      api: \"Firecrawl\",\n      purpose: \"Scrape full article content from URLs\",\n      freeTier: \"500 credits/month (free tier)\",\n      why: \"Extracts clean markdown from any URL for research depth\",\n      keyName: \"FIRECRAWL_KEY\",\n      isConfigured: Boolean(process.env.FIRECRAWL_KEY)\n    },\n    {\n      api: \"Jina AI Reader\",\n      purpose: \"Free URL -> markdown (no key needed)\",\n      freeTier: \"Unlimited\",\n      why: \"Zero-cost fallback for content extraction\",\n      keyName: \"NONE\",\n      isConfigured: true\n    }\n  ],\n  media: [\n    {\n      service: \"Pexels API\",\n      purpose: \"Stock photos/videos for B-roll, thumbnails\",\n      freeTier: \"200 requests/hour, 20,000/month\",\n      why: \"High quality, royalty-free, no attribution required, vertical video clips available\",\n      keyName: \"PEXELS_API_KEY\",\n      isConfigured: Boolean(process.env.PEXELS_API_KEY),\n      docUrl: \"https://www.pexels.com/api/\"\n    },\n    {\n      service: \"ComfyUI (local)\",\n      purpose: \"Custom image genera