  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the update to align the front-end layout with the **n8n workflow dashboard** reference while connecting real data and execution logic based on the **Free Tier APIs & Models Reference**:\n\n- **n8n Workflow Canvas Architecture**:\n  - Rebuilt the canvas to reflect the visual design of n8n, featuring the dark dot-matrix grid, coral red brand mark, top workflow header with status indicators, and SVG bezier spline wires connecting nodes with active execution pulses.\n  - Implemented the central **AI Agent orchestrator** with dedicated bottom sub-pins for Chat Model (`gemini-3.6-flash`), Think Reasoning, SQLite Memory (`vault.db`), and sub-agent clusters (Researcher, Scriptwriter, Art & Style, Video Editor, QC & HITL, Poster, and Analyst).\n  - Added canvas navigation controls: smooth canvas panning, zoom level controls, fit-to-screen, and quick agent centering.\n\n- **Real Data & Interactive Node Inspector**:\n  - Clicking any node opens the **Node Inspector Drawer**, providing real parameter inspection, free-tier quotas and architectural rationales, and an **\"Execute Step\"** button that runs real backend logic.\n  - Returns real formatted payloads: YouTube search metrics with view counts and retention benchmarks, verified 9:16 vertical video clips from Pexels, Edge-TTS SSML speech packets, FFmpeg video assembly flags, and social post payloads.\n\n- **Executions View & History**:\n  - Integrated a dedicated **Executions tab** in the top switcher to browse past and live pipeline runs, execution durations, trigger origins, and step-by-step traces with real timings and output JSON.\n\n- **Free-Tier Limits & Models Modal**:\n  - Surfaced the **Free Tier APIs & Models Reference** directly within the application, categorizing daily and rate-limit quotas across Google AI Studio models (`gemini-3.6-flash`, `gemini-3.7-flash`, `gemini-2.5-pro`), video research APIs, TTS/assembly tools, and self-hosted distribution services."
    modified_response: "I have completed the update to align the front-end layout with the **n8n workflow dashboard** reference while connecting real data and execution logic based on the **Free Tier APIs & Models Reference**:\n\n- **n8n Workflow Canvas Architecture**:\n  - Rebuilt the canvas to reflect the visual design of n8n, featuring the dark dot-matrix grid, coral red brand mark, top workflow header with status indicators, and SVG bezier spline wires connecting nodes with active execution pulses.\n  - Implemented the central **AI Agent orchestrator** with dedicated bottom sub-pins for Chat Model (`gemini-3.6-flash`), Think Reasoning, SQLite Memory (`vault.db`), and sub-agent clusters (Researcher, Scriptwriter, Art & Style, Video Editor, QC & HITL, Poster, and Analyst).\n  - Added canvas navigation controls: smooth canvas panning, zoom level controls, fit-to-screen, and quick agent centering.\n\n- **Real Data & Interactive Node Inspector**:\n  - Clicking any node opens the **Node Inspector Drawer**, providing real parameter inspection, free-tier quotas and architectural rationales, and an **\"Execute Step\"** button that runs real backend logic.\n  - Returns real formatted payloads: YouTube search metrics with view counts and retention benchmarks, verified 9:16 vertical video clips from Pexels, Edge-TTS SSML speech packets, FFmpeg video assembly flags, and social post payloads.\n\n- **Executions View & History**:\n  - Integrated a dedicated **Executions tab** in the top switcher to browse past and live pipeline runs, execution durations, trigger origins, and step-by-step traces with real timings and output JSON.\n\n- **Free-Tier Limits & Models Modal**:\n  - Surfaced the **Free Tier APIs & Models Reference** directly within the application, categorizing daily and rate-limit quotas across Google AI Studio models (`gemini-3.6-flash`, `gemini-3.7-flash`, `gemini-2.5-pro`), video research APIs, TTS/assembly tools, and self-hosted distribution services."
