el\" button for interaction.\n\n\n\n**Detailing Output Views**\n\nI\'m now detailing the full functionality preview, focusing on output and input views for highlighted nodes. For the \"Final Video\" node, I\'ve designed a video preview with play controls and download options. Similarly, the \"Voice Generator\" will display a playable audio bar. I\'m also considering display modes like \"Formatted View\", \"Table\", and \"JSON Tree\" to showcase data effectively.\n\n\n**Defining Output Details**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the specific output formats for several nodes. The \"Upload a video\" node will display a YouTube Shorts card with title, link, and status. The AI Agent\'s output includes a system reasoning box, structured JSON, and cost details. Image Prompt Generator shows storyboard shot cards with detailed cinematographic prompts. Stock videos will feature thumbnail previews. I\'m also including competitor intelligence data within the YouTube Data API v3 node, and structured input parameters in the Input Formatter.\n\n\n"
