ent-analyst\", toNode: \"node-tool-feedback-loop\", type: \"dashed\" }\n    ];"
      replacement_content: "  // Get Workflow Graph Specification (Nodes, Edges, Sub-pins matching n8n architecture)\n  app.get(\"/api/workflow/spec\", (req, res) => {\n    // Generously spaced nodes matching the clean horizontal pipeline shown in n8n reference videos\n    const nodes = [\n      // 1. Trigger Node\n      {\n        id: \"node-trigger\",\n        name: \"When clicking \'Execute workflow\'\",\n        label: \"Execute Workflow\",\n        subtitle: \"Manual or Webhook trigger\",\n        category: \"trigger\",\n        iconName: \"Play\",\n        x: 80,\n        y: 180,\n        width: 190,\n        height: 74,\n        status: \"idle\",\n        outputs: [{ id: \"out-main\", label: \"\", type: \"main\" }],\n        freeTierInfo: {\n          tierName: \"Manual & Telegram Trigger\",\n          quotaLimit: \"Unlimited\",\n          whyChosen: \"Instant UI execution or Telegram push webhook\",\n          apiKeyName: \"NONE\",\n          isConfigured: true\n        }\n      },\n      // 2. Input Formatter / Edit Fields\n      {\n        id: \"node-edit-fields\",\n        name: \"Edit Fields\",\n        label: \"Edit Fields\",\n        subtitle: \"Format niche & parameters\",\n        category: \"routing\",\n        iconName: \"FileSpreadsheet\",\n        x: 360,\n        y: 180,\n        width: 190,\n        height: 74,\n        status: \"idle\",\n        inputs: [{ id: \"in-main\", label: \"\", type: \"main\" }],\n        outputs: [{ id: \"out-main\", label: \"\", type: \"main\" }]\n      },\n      // 3. Central AI Agent Orchestrator\n      {\n        id: \"node-ai-agent\",\n        name: \"AI Agent\",\n        label: \"AI Agent\",\n        subtitle: \"Content Factory Manager\",\n        category: \"agent\",\n        iconName: \"Bot\",\n        x: 650,\n        y: 160,\n        width: 230,\n        height: 98,\n        status: \"idle\",\n        inputs: [{ id: \"in-main\", label: \"\", type: \"main\" }],\n        outputs: [\n          { id: \"out-success\", label: \"Success\", type: \"success\" },\n          { id: \"out-error\", label: \"Error\", type: \"error\" }\n        ],\n        subPins: {\n          model: true,\n          think: true,\n          memory: true,\n          tools: true\n        },\n        freeTierInfo: {\n          tierName: \"gemini-3.6-flash (Primary LLM)\",\n          quotaLimit: \"15 RPM, 1,500 RPD, 1M tokens/min\",\n          whyChosen: \"Fastest, cheapest, structured JSON schema output, 1M context\",\n          apiKeyName: \"GEMINI_API_KEY\",\n          isConfigured: Boolean(process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY && process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY !== \"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\")\n        }\n      },\n      // Model sub-node under AI Agent\n      {\n        id: \"node-model-gemini-flash\",\n        name: \"Gemini Chat Model\",\n        label: \"gemini-3.6-flash\",\n        subtitle: \"Chat Model (15 RPM Free)\",\n        category: \"model\",\n        iconName: \"Cpu\",\n        x: 500,\n        y: 340,\n        width: 180,\n        height: 72,\n        status: \"idle\",\n        freeTierInfo: {\n          tierName: \"Google AI Studio Free Tier\",\n          quotaLimit: \"15 RPM, 1,500 RPD, 1.5M tokens/day\",\n          whyChosen: \"Generates high retention scripts with JSON schema without credit card\",\n          apiKeyName: \"GEMINI_API_KEY\",\n          isConfigured: Boolean(process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY && process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY !== \"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"),\n          docUrl: \"https://aistudio.google.com/apikey\"\n        }\n      },\n      // Director reasoning prompt\n      {\n        id: \"node-think-prompt\",\n        name: \"Think Reasoning\",\n        label: \"Think\",\n        subtitle: \"Director System Directive\",\n        category: \"agent\",\n        iconName: \"Brain\",\n        x: 710,\n        y: 340,\n        width: 170,\n        height: 72,\n        status: \"idle\"\n      },\n      // Vault Memory\n      {\n        id: \"node-vault-memory\",\n        name: \"Simple Memory\",\n        l