  planner_response {
    response: "I have spaced out every part of the workflow and enhanced label readability across the canvas:\n\n- **Generous Node Spacing**:\n  - **Telegram Trigger & Switch**: Separated with a clear 110px gap, eliminating the previous touching cards and giving the connector line clean visibility.\n  - **Download Voice File & Transcribe Audio**: Spaced out with a 120px gap, giving each voice pipeline node dedicated breathing room.\n  - **Input Consolidator & AI Agent**: Spaced with a 120px margin so the central manager sits with distinct visual clarity.\n  - **Models, Reasoning & Memory**: Adjusted the sub-nodes attached below the AI Agent (`gemini-3.6-flash`, `Think Reasoning`, and `Simple Memory`) with 60px horizontal margins to eliminate previous card overlaps.\n  - **Sub-Agent Pods & Tools**: Arranged the 7 specialized agent pods (Art & Style, Video Editor, Research, Scriptwriter, Quality Control, Poster, and Analyst) with clean 30\342\200\223120px margins between all tool cards, preventing overlapping across the board.\n\n- **High-Clarity Typography & Card Sizing**:\n  - Expanded card widths and removed artificial text truncations so labels like `Telegram Trigger`, `Download Voice File`, `Transcribe Audio`, and `gemini-3.6-flash` display clearly without being abruptly cut off.\n  - Added native tooltip descriptors (`title`) to all node headers and subtitles.\n\n- **Interactive Hover & Tap Summaries**:\n  - Hovering or tapping any node reveals an expanded, high-contrast drawer directly beneath it showing its purpose, quota limits, and execution role."
